OL,3,GNEWSAThe swan sanctuary wetland
OL,4,Afighting climate change
OL,5,
OL,6,FMost people know rainforests are vital
OL,7,Fin the fight against climate change,
OL,8,Fbut now scientists say wetlands could
OL,9,Fbe even more important.
OL,11,FSaltmarshes, mangrove swamps and
OL,12,Fwetlands can absorb carbon "four times
OL,13,Ffaster than trees", according to the
OL,14,Fcharity the Wildfowl and Wetlands Trust
OL,15,F(WWT).
OL,17,FCelebrating 80 years since WWT's first
OL,18,Fwetland bird reserve was founded at
OL,19,FSlimbridge, in Gloucestershire, the
OL,20,Fcharity's leaders have called for one
OL,21,Fmillion hectares of wetlands to be
OL,22,Frestored across the world.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,348,340,200,160,0,100
