OL,3,GNEWSAThe swan sanctuary wetland
OL,4,Afighting climate change
OL,5,
OL,6,FSarah Fowler, CEO of WWT, said: "They
OL,7,Fare mood-boosting, flood-buffering,
OL,8,Fwater-purifying, incredible habitats.
OL,9,FBut we have lost 85% of the world's
OL,10,Fwetlands."
